      "cooked": "<p>Hi, I’m a a Noob who just picked this game up at Gen-Con.  My gf and I have been playing it since we got home <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\">  I jsut had one quick question.  In the Metropolis, Environment cards, there is a card called “Traffic Pileup”  I just wanted to clarify, is the little blue 10 at teh upper left hand corner how many rounds the card stays in play, or is it some form of HP’s.<br>\nAwesome game, and good luck to you guys   ;D<br>\nNinja Artist Billy</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.461377546063.272529.765326063\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.461377546063.272529.765326063</a><br>\n((Ì²Ì… Ì²Ì…(Ì²Ì…CÌ²Ì…rÌ²Ì…aÌ²Ì…yÌ²Ì…oÌ²Ì…lÌ²Ì²Ì…Ì…aÌ²Ì…( Ì²Ì…Ì…((&gt;</p>\n<p>Flash Game:<br>\n<a href=\"http://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/Bill%27s%20Flash%20Game/flash.html\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/Bill's%20Flash%20Game/flash.html</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/</a></p>",
