      "raw": "Hi, I'm a a Noob who just picked this game up at Gen-Con.  My gf and I have been playing it since we got home :)  I jsut had one quick question.  In the Metropolis, Environment cards, there is a card called \"Traffic Pileup\"  I just wanted to clarify, is the little blue 10 at teh upper left hand corner how many rounds the card stays in play, or is it some form of HP's.  \nAwesome game, and good luck to you guys   ;D\nNinja Artist Billy\n\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/media/set/?set=a.461377546063.272529.765326063\n((Ì²Ì… Ì²Ì…(Ì²Ì…CÌ²Ì…rÌ²Ì…aÌ²Ì…yÌ²Ì…oÌ²Ì…lÌ²Ì²Ì…Ì…aÌ²Ì…( Ì²Ì…Ì…((>\n\nFlash Game:\nhttp://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/Bill%27s%20Flash%20Game/flash.html\n\nhttp://www.cs.iupui.edu/~whjohnso/n241/",
